'''Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa'''<ref name="Getty">{{Getty|url=thewaltdisneystudios/allaccess/#!asset/bj8gqtnvm799njt6mjc6t|text=GR-FF-001420|date=2024-12-23}}</ref> was a location that was situated on top of the [[Skull Ridge Mountain]] on the [[planet]] [[Lanupa]].<ref name="You Have a Lot" />

From its previous role as [[Captain Rennod's Lair]], the facilities had altered quite drastically. The acid baths that used to be used for execution, for example, had been converted into mud baths for paying guests to the exclusive and child-free hotel and spa. Likewise, the former fighting pits had undergone a reconstruction into the modern spa.

These changes greatly angered [[SM-33]], who initally thought a pair of pleasure yachts were a crew of pirates.

